{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Restart an otter managed container environment   {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reboot  [options] [container]{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter restart [options] [container]{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reboot my-box{R}                              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reboot --all{R}                               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter restart my-box{R}                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter restart --all --root{R}                       {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Restart all otter containers{R}      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Restart rootful containers{R}        {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}            {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Wraps 'otter stop' and 'otter start' internally.{R}  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Works on both running and stopped containers.{R}     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}On a stopped container, it simply starts it.{R}      {2}│{R}
